<mj-body>
<!--HEADER-->
<mj-section background-color="#1e3a5f">
<mj-column>
<mj-text font-size="28px"><span style="color:#ffffff">Fix</span><span style=" color:#f4a823">It</span></mj-text>
</mj-column>
<mj-column >
<mj-text color="#6b7280">Trusted Local Services</mj-text>
</mj-column>

</mj-section>

<mj-section background-color="#1e3a5f" padding="0">

<mj-column padding="0" >
<mj-text ><span style="display:inline-block; background-color:rgba(244, 168, 35, 0.15); border:1px solid rgba(244,168,35,0.3); color:#f4a823; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase; padding:6px 14px; border-radius:20px;"><span style="font-size:20px;">&#127881;</span> Welcome to the  community</span></mj-text>



<mj-text font-size="28px"  font-weight="bold"><div style="color:#ffffff">Find trusted help,</div><div style="color:#f4a823"> right in your city.</div></mj-text>


<mj-text align="left" color="#6b7280" font-size="20px">Your account is ready.Browse vetted plumbers, electricians, cleaners,tutors and more - all reviewed by real people in your area.</mj-text>
<mj-button align="left" background-color="#f4a823" color="#1e3a5f" font-weight="bold">Browse Services <span style="font-size:20px;">&#8594;</span></mj-button>
<mj-text color="#ffffff">Learn how it works</mj-text>

<mj-text padding="0" font-size="14px">
  <div style="background-color:#f4a823; padding:0 10px; height:40px; line-height:40px; text-align:center; color:#1e3a5f; font-weight:600;">
   <span style="font-size:20px;">&#128075;</span> Hi user — here's how to get the most out of FixIt
  </div>
</mj-text>
    </mj-column>
</mj-section>
<mj-section background-color="#ffffff">
  <mj-column width="100%">
    <mj-text>
      <span style="color: #f4a823; text-transform:uppercase;">
        Getting Started
      </span>
    </mj-text>

    <mj-text font-size="20px" color="#1e3a5f">
      Three steps to finding great help
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>

<mj-section background-color="#ffffff" >
<mj-column width="10%" >
<mj-text align="center" >
      <span style="
        display:inline-block;
        background-color:#1e3a5f;
        height:30px;
        width:30px;
        line-height:30px;
        border-radius:50%;
        color:#ffffff;
        text-align:center;
        font-size:14px;
      ">
        01
      </span>
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>

  <!-- Text content -->
  <mj-column width="70%" vertical-align="middle" >
    <mj-text  align="left" >
      <strong>Search your service</strong>
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text align="left" >
      Browse by category or search directly. Filter by location, rating and availability to find exactly what you need.
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>

<mj-section background-color="#ffffff">
  
  <!-- Number circle -->
  <mj-column width="10%" vertical-align="middle">
    <mj-text align="center">
      <span style="
        display:inline-block;
        background-color:#f4a823;
        height:30px;
        width:30px;
        line-height:30px;
        border-radius:50%;
        color:#ffffff;
        text-align:center;
        font-size:14px;
      ">
        02
      </span>
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>

  <!-- Text content -->
  <mj-column width="70%" vertical-align="middle">
    <mj-text>
      <strong>Compare profiles and reviews</strong>
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text>
      Read verified reviews from real customers.See ratings, pricing, and experience before you reach out.
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
  

</mj-section>

<mj-section background-color="#ffffff">
<mj-column width="10%" vertical-align="middle">
<mj-text align="center">
      <span style="
        display:inline-block;
        background-color:#1e3a5f;
        height:30px;
        width:30px;
        line-height:30px;
        border-radius:50%;
        color:#ffffff;
        text-align:center;
        font-size:14px;
      ">
        03
      </span>
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>

  <!-- Text content -->
  <mj-column width="70%" vertical-align="middle">
    <mj-text>
      <strong>Contact directly, no middleman</strong>
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text>
      Message or call service providers directly. No commission fees, no platform markups.Just honest local work.
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>

<mj-section background-color="#ffffff">
<mj-column>
<mj-text><span style="color:#f4a823; text-transform:uppercase; font-size:14px;font-weight:bold">Browse by category</mj-text>
<mj-text font-size="24px" color="#1e3a5f" font-weight="bold">What do you need help with?</mj-text>
</mj-column>
</mj-section>

